# Trained policy artifacts live here. The small state-based policy.onnx
# (~7 KB) is committed. Larger artifacts — vision bundles, .pt checkpoints —
# stay untracked: their source of truth is the training repo's
# logs/<task>/rsl_rl/<run>/exported/, and committing them would bloat
# this repo fast across retrains.
*_vision.onnx
*.pt
